{"text": "On a rainy afternoon, Lena and her grandad made a white paper boat. When the rain stopped, Lena put the boat into a little stream. The boat sailed very fast, and Lena ran next to it, laughing. Suddenly, the boat got stuck between two big stones. Grandad found a long stick and gently pushed the boat free. In the evening, the little boat floated on the pond with the ducklings.", "words": [[0.48, 0.56], [0.62, 0.65], [0.76, 1.06], [1.26, 1.88], [2.38, 2.68], [2.76, 2.86], [2.88, 2.98], [3.02, 3.6], [3.96, 4.12], [4.16, 4.19], [4.3, 4.6], [4.68, 5.02], [5.08, 5.36], [6.92, 7.04], [7.06, 7.12], [7.22, 7.5], [7.68, 8.12], [8.58, 8.82], [8.9, 9.06], [9.1, 9.18], [9.24, 9.5], [9.62, 9.8], [9.86, 9.89], [9.94, 10.16], [10.28, 10.74], [12.3, 12.38], [12.44, 12.7], [12.82, 13.18], [13.26, 13.48], [13.62, 14.14], [14.52, 14.62], [14.68, 14.92], [15.02, 15.22], [15.3, 15.56], [15.6, 15.68], [15.76, 15.86], [16.16, 16.68], [18.24, 18.66], [19.04, 19.12], [19.16, 19.38], [19.46, 19.64], [19.74, 20.04], [20.16, 20.52], [20.6, 20.8], [20.92, 21.1], [21.2, 21.8], [23.28, 23.84], [23.92, 24.2], [24.26, 24.29], [24.38, 24.68], [24.86, 25.2], [25.64, 25.74], [25.8, 26.14], [26.24, 26.54], [26.58, 26.64], [26.68, 26.9], [27.0, 27.3], [28.88, 28.94], [28.98, 29.06], [29.2, 29.62], [30.0, 30.08], [30.14, 30.38], [30.46, 30.72], [30.84, 31.24], [31.28, 31.34], [31.36, 31.44], [31.5, 31.94], [32.24, 32.38], [32.4, 32.48], [32.56, 33.415]], "scenes": [0.0, 6.48, 11.86, 17.76, 22.83, 28.41], "tag": "kokoro:bm_george", "fx": "pb1", "aligned": "ctc1", "clamped": 1}